<?php if($action):?><section class="card"><h2><?=sh($action['title'])?> <span class="tag <?=sh($action['status'])?>"><?=['draft'=>'Entwurf','active'=>'Aktiv','closed'=>'Bestellschluss erreicht','completed'=>'Abgeschlossen'][$action['status']]?></span></h2><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?=sh($csrf)?>"><input type="hidden" name="do" value="save_action"><input type="hidden" name="action_id" value="<?=(int)$selected?>"><div class="grid"><label class="field">Titel<input name="title" required value="<?=sh($action['title'])?>" <?= $action['status']==='completed'?'disabled':''?>></label><label class="field">Bestellstart<input type="date" name="start_date" required value="<?=sh($action['start_date'])?>" <?= $action['status']==='completed'?'disabled':''?>></label><label class="field">Bestellende<input type="date" name="end_date" required value="<?=sh($action['end_date'])?>" <?= $action['status']==='completed'?'disabled':''?>></label><label class="field">Versandkosten (€)<input type="number" min="0" step="0.01" name="shipping" value="<?=number_format($action['shipping_cents']/100,2,'.','')?>" <?= $action['status']==='completed'?'disabled':''?>></label><label class="field">Status<select name="status" <?= $action['status']==='completed'?'disabled':''?>><option value="draft" <?=$action['status']==='draft'?'selected':''?>>Entwurf</option><option value="active" <?=$action['status']==='active'?'selected':''?>>Aktiv</option><option value="closed" <?=$action['status']==='closed'?'selected':''?>>Bestellschluss erreicht</option></select></label><label class="field">Beschreibung<textarea name="description" rows="2" <?= $action['status']==='completed'?'disabled':''?>><?=sh($action['description'])?></textarea></label></div><?php if($action['status']!=='completed'):?><button class="btn btn-primary btnwide">Aktion speichern</button><?php endif;?></form><p>Öffentliche Bestellseite: <a href="../bestellen/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">/bestellen/</a></p><?php if($action['status']!=='completed'):?><form method="post" onsubmit="return confirm('Aktion abschließen? Danach sind Artikelpreise und Versandkosten eingefroren.');"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?=sh($csrf)?>"><input type="hidden" name="do" value="complete_action"><input type="hidden" name="action_id" value="<?=$selected?>"><button class="btn btn-success btnwide">Aktion abschließen und Werte einfrieren</button></form><?php elseif($action['completed_at']&&strtotime($action['completed_at'])<=strtotime('-1 year')):?><form method="post" onsubmit="return confirm('Alle Daten dieser Aktion endgültig löschen?');"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?=sh($csrf)?>"><input type="hidden" name="do" value="delete_action"><input type="hidden" name="action_id" value="<?=$selected?>"><button class="btn btnwide">Aktion nach Aufbewahrungsfrist löschen</button></form><?php else:?><p class="muted">Löschung frühestens ein Jahr nach Abschluss möglich.</p><?php endif;?></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Artikel</h2><?php if($action['status']!=='completed'):?><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?=sh($csrf)?>"><input type="hidden" name="do" value="add_item"><input type="hidden" name="action_id" value="<?=$selected?>"><div class="grid"><label class="field">Artikelname<input name="item_name" required></label><label class="field">Einkaufspreis (€)<input type="number" name="purchase_price" min="0" step="0.01" required></label><label class="field">Verkaufspreis (€)<input type="number" name="sale_price" min="0" step="0.01" required></label><label class="field"><span>An Eltern verkaufen?</span><span><input type="checkbox" name="sold_to_parents" checked style="width:auto"> Ja, öffentlich bestellbar</span></label></div><button class="btn btn-primary btnwide">Artikel hinzufügen</button></form><?php endif;?><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Artikel</th><th>Einkaufspreis</th><th>Verkaufspreis</th><th>Elternverkauf</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($items as $it):?><tr><td><?=sh($it['name'])?></td><td><?=salesMoney((int)$it['purchase_price_cents'])?></td><td><?=salesMoney((int)$it['sale_price_cents'])?></td><td><?=$it['sold_to_parents']?'Ja':'Nein – nur intern'?></td><td><?php if($action['status']!=='completed'):?><details><summary>Bearbeiten</summary><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?=sh($csrf)?>"><input type="hidden" name="do" value="update_item"><input type="hidden" name="action_id" value="<?=$selected?>"><input type="hidden" name="item_id" value="<?=$it['id']?>"><label class="field">Name<input name="item_name" value="<?=sh($it['name'])?>" required></label><label class="field">Einkaufspreis<input type="number" name="purchase_price" min="0" step=".01" value="<?=number_format($it['purchase_price_cents']/100,2,'.','')?>" required></label><label class="field">Verkaufspreis<input type="number" name="sale_price" min="0" step=".01" value="<?=number_format($it['sale_price_cents']/100,2,'.','')?>" required></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="sold_to_parents" <?=$it['sold_to_parents']?'checked':''?>> An Eltern verkaufen</label><button class="btn btn-primary btnwide">Speichern</button></form><form method="post" onsubmit="return confirm('Artikel löschen?');"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?=sh($csrf)?>"><input type="hidden" name="do" value="delete_item"><input type="hidden" name="action_id" value="<?=$selected?>"><input type="hidden" name="item_id" value="<?=$it['id']?>"><button class="btnwide">Artikel löschen</button></form></details><?php endif;?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Finanzübersicht</h2><div class="stats"><div class="stat">Erwarteter Verkaufserlös<strong><?=salesMoney($stats['revenue'])?></strong></div><div class="stat">Zahlungseingänge (bezahlt markiert)<strong><?=salesMoney($stats['paid'])?></strong></div><div class="stat">Einkaufskosten<strong><?=salesMoney($stats['purchase'])?></strong></div><div class="stat">Versandkosten<strong><?=salesMoney((int)$action['shipping_cents'])?></strong></div><div class="stat">Gesamtkosten<strong><?=salesMoney($stats['cost_with_shipping']??$stats['purchase']+(int)$action['shipping_cents'])?></strong></div><div class="stat">Voraussichtlicher Überschuss<strong><?=salesMoney($stats['surplus']??($stats['revenue']-$stats['purchase']-(int)$action['shipping_cents']))?></strong></div></div><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Artikel</th><th>Elternmenge</th><th>Interne Menge</th><th>Gesamt zu bestellen</th><th>Einkaufspreis</th><th>Gesamtkosten</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($items as $it):$pq=0;foreach($orders as $o){$q=$conn->prepare('SELECT COALESCE(SUM(quantity),0) FROM sales_order_items WHERE order_id=? AND item_id=?');$q->execute([$o['id'],$it['id']]);$pq+=(int)$q->fetchColumn();}$iq=$internal[$it['id']]??0;$totalQty=$pq+$iq;?><tr><td><?=sh($it['name'])?></td><td><?=$pq?></td><td><?=$iq?></td><td><strong><?=$totalQty?></strong></td><td><?=salesMoney((int)$it['purchase_price_cents'])?></td><td><?=salesMoney($totalQty*(int)$it['purchase_price_cents'])?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Interne Bestellung (Kindergarten)</h2><p>Hier die zusätzlichen Mengen für den Kindergarten eintragen. Alle Artikel stehen zur Verfügung, auch solche, die nicht an Eltern verkauft werden.</p><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?=sh($csrf)?>"><input type="hidden" name="do" value="save_internal"><input type="hidden" name="action_id" value="<?=$selected?>"><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Artikel</th><th>Einkaufspreis</th><th>Interne Menge</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($items as $it):?><tr><td><?=sh($it['name'])?></td><td><?=salesMoney((int)$it['purchase_price_cents'])?></td><td><input type="number" name="internal_qty[<?=$it['id']?>]" min="0" max="100000" value="<?=$internal[$it['id']]??0?>" <?=$action['status']==='completed'?'disabled':''?>></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div><?php if($action['status']!=='completed'):?><button class="btn btn-primary btnwide">Interne Bestellung speichern</button><?php endif;?></form></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Elternbestellungen (<?=count($orders)?>)</h2><div class="filters"><input id="orderSearch" placeholder="Name oder E-Mail suchen"><select id="groupFilter"><option value="">Alle Gruppen</option><?php foreach($groups as $g):?><option value="<?=sh($g['name'])?>"><?=sh($g['name'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select><select id="statusFilter"><option value="">Alle Bestellungen</option><option value="unpaid">Nicht bezahlt</option><option value="unpacked">Nicht gepackt</option><option value="unissued">Nicht ausgegeben</option></select></div><div class="tablewrap"><table id="ordersTable"><thead><tr><th>Bestellnr.</th><th>Name / E-Mail</th><th>Gruppe</th><?php foreach($items as $it):?><th><?=sh($it['name'])?></th><?php endforeach;?><th>Gesamt</th><th>Bezahlt</th><th>Gepackt</th><th>Ausgegeben</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($orders as $o):$q=$conn->prepare('SELECT group_name FROM sales_groups WHERE id=?');$q->execute([$o['group_id']]);$gname=(string)$q->fetchColumn();$oi=$conn->prepare('SELECT item_id,quantity FROM sales_order_items WHERE order_id=?');$oi->execute([$o['id']]);$qtymap=[];foreach($oi->fetchAll(PDO::FETCH_ASSOC) as $r)$qtymap[(int)$r['item_id']]=(int)$r['quantity'];?><tr data-name="<?=sh(mb_strtolower($o['customer_name'].' '.$o['customer_email']))?>" data-group="<?=sh($gname)?>" data-paid="<?=$o['is_paid']?'1':'0'?>" data-packed="<?=$o['is_packed']?'1':'0'?>" data-issued="<?=$o['is_issued']?'1':'0'?>"><td><?=sh($o['order_number'])?><br><small><?=date('d.m.Y H:i',strtotime($o['created_at']))?></small></td><td><strong><?=sh($o['customer_name'])?></strong><br><a href="mailto:<?=sh($o['customer_email'])?>"><?=sh($o['customer_email'])?></a></td><td><?=sh($gname)?></td><?php foreach($items as $it):?><td><?=$qtymap[$it['id']]??0?></td><?php endforeach;?><td><?=salesMoney((int)$o['total_cents'])?></td><?php foreach(['is_paid'=>'Bezahlt','is_packed'=>'Gepackt','is_issued'=>'Ausgegeben'] as $field=>$label):?><td><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?=sh($csrf)?>"><input type="hidden" name="do" value="order_status"><input type="hidden" name="action_id" value="<?=$selected?>"><input type="hidden" name="order_id" value="<?=$o['id']?>"><input type="hidden" name="field" value="<?=$field?>"><input type="checkbox" name="value" value="1" <?=$o[$field]?'checked':''?> onchange="this.form.submit()" aria-label="<?=$label?> für <?=sh($o['customer_name'])?>"></form></td><?php endforeach;?><td><form method="post" onsubmit="return confirm('Bestellung endgültig löschen? Sie wird vollständig aus allen Berechnungen entfernt.');"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?=sh($csrf)?>"><input type="hidden" name="do" value="delete_order"><input type="hidden" name="action_id" value="<?=$selected?>"><input type="hidden" name="order_id" value="<?=$o['id']?>"><button class="smallbtn" title="Bestellung löschen"><i class="fas fa-trash"></i></button></form></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div></section>
<?php endif;?>
<section class="card"><h2>Gruppen verwalten</h2><p>Die Namen dieser Gruppen erscheinen im öffentlichen Bestellformular.</p><div class="grid"><?php foreach($groups as $g):?><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?=sh($csrf)?>"><input type="hidden" name="do" value="save_group"><input type="hidden" name="group_id" value="<?=$g['id']?>"><label class="field">Gruppe<input name="group_name" value="<?=sh($g['name'])?>" required></label><button class="btn btn-primary btnwide">Umbenennen</button></form><?php endforeach;?><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?=sh($csrf)?>"><input type="hidden" name="do" value="save_group"><label class="field">Neue Gruppe<input name="group_name" required></label><input type="hidden" name="sort_order" value="<?=count($groups)+1?>"><button class="btn btn-primary btnwide">Gruppe hinzufügen</button></form></div></section>
</main></div><script>
const search=document.getElementById('orderSearch'),gf=document.getElementById('groupFilter'),sf=document.getElementById('statusFilter');function filterOrders(){document.querySelectorAll('#ordersTable tbody tr').forEach(r=>{let ok=(!search||r.dataset.name.includes(search.value.toLowerCase()))&&(!gf||!gf.value||r.dataset.group===gf.value);if(sf&&sf.value==='unpaid')ok=ok&&r.dataset.paid==='0';if(sf&&sf.value==='unpacked')ok=ok&&r.dataset.packed==='0';if(sf&&sf.value==='unissued')ok=ok&&r.dataset.issued==='0';r.hidden=!ok})} [search,gf,sf].filter(Boolean).forEach(e=>e.addEventListener('input',filterOrders));
</script></body></html>
